`Object.defineProperty` with the key `[CELL]`, which the program also writes directly, is not supported yet
an accessor defined with `Object.defineProperty` is not supported yet
`Object.defineProperty` changing the attributes of `n` is not supported yet
`Object.defineProperty` of `[MARK]` on a `{ a: f64 }`, which doesn't declare it, is not supported yet
`Object.defineProperties` is not supported yet
